### Phase 3 — Channel Expansion

Adds Vapi voice, Gmail portal intercept, and Instagram DM channels.

---

#### [NEW] [vapi.py](file:///c:/Users/ZBOOK%20STUDIO%20G5/Documents/dev/reva/app/webhooks/vapi.py)

Vapi.ai voice inbound webhook:
- Receive call events (call.started, transcription, call.ended)
- First 2 minutes: qualification via Reva prompt
- Auto-book if qualified, or live-transfer to agent
- Transcript feeds into conversation context like a normal message

#### [NEW] [portal_intercept.py](file:///c:/Users/ZBOOK%20STUDIO%20G5/Documents/dev/reva/app/services/portal_intercept.py)

Gmail API integration for PropertyPro / Nigeria Property Centre:
- Poll inbox for emails matching sender patterns
- Parse lead phone number from email body (regex patterns)
- Extract property interest from email subject/body
- Initiate WhatsApp outreach within 60 seconds via [send_outbound_message](file:///c:/Users/ZBOOK%20STUDIO%20G5/Documents/dev/reva/app/services/messaging.py#101-116)
- Mark email as read to avoid re-processing

#### [NEW] [instagram.py](file:///c:/Users/ZBOOK%20STUDIO%20G5/Documents/dev/reva/app/webhooks/instagram.py)

Meta Graph API webhook for Instagram DMs:
- Receive `messaging` events from Instagram webhook
- Parse into [IncomingMessage](file:///c:/Users/ZBOOK%20STUDIO%20G5/Documents/dev/reva/app/models/lead.py#21-28) via `gateway.ingest()`
- Responses sent back via Instagram Send API

#### [MODIFY] [messaging.py](file:///c:/Users/ZBOOK%20STUDIO%20G5/Documents/dev/reva/app/services/messaging.py)

- Add `send_instagram_message(ig_user_id, text)` function
- Add `send_vapi_response()` for voice channel responses
- Update [send_outbound_message](file:///c:/Users/ZBOOK%20STUDIO%20G5/Documents/dev/reva/app/services/messaging.py#101-116) router for new sources: `"instagram"`, `"vapi"`, `"portal_email"`

