### Phase 4 — Agent Management & Routing

Full agent command set + calendar booking engine + development-scoped routing.

---

#### [MODIFY] [agent_commands.py](file:///c:/Users/ZBOOK%20STUDIO%20G5/Documents/dev/reva/app/services/agent_commands.py)

Add missing commands:
- `TAKEOVER <phone>`: Set lead as agent-active in Redis + DB. Reva stops responding to that lead.
- `HANDBACK <phone>`: Clear agent-active flag. Reva resumes with full context.
- `STATUS`: Return today's stats (leads received, qualified, meetings booked, deals closed)
- `CLOSED <phone> <amount>`: Already exists. Add revenue dashboard update.

#### [NEW] [google_calendar.py](file:///c:/Users/ZBOOK%20STUDIO%20G5/Documents/dev/reva/app/services/google_calendar.py)

Google Calendar API integration (complements existing Calendly):
- Create events on agent's Google Calendar
- 3-slot offer within WhatsApp (already in [calendar.py](file:///c:/Users/ZBOOK%20STUDIO%20G5/Documents/dev/reva/app/services/calendar.py) but with mock slots)
- Actual free/busy lookup via Google Calendar API
- Confirmation message to lead + briefing message to agent

#### [MODIFY] [agent_notify.py](file:///c:/Users/ZBOOK%20STUDIO%20G5/Documents/dev/reva/app/services/agent_notify.py)

- [assign_agent()](file:///c:/Users/ZBOOK%20STUDIO%20G5/Documents/dev/reva/app/services/agent_notify.py#44-76): Scope to development (currently global round-robin)
- Add fallback: if no agent for development, route to any active agent
- Score-based override: 8+ goes to `senior_agent` field on agent record
- Send agent briefing with full lead profile on assignment

