### Phase 5 — Background Jobs

Three new scheduled jobs + centralised scheduler.

---

#### [NEW] [resurrection.py](file:///c:/Users/ZBOOK%20STUDIO%20G5/Documents/dev/reva/app/jobs/resurrection.py)

Weekly Monday 9am job:
- Find leads with >=60 days inactivity, not booked, not closed
- Send re-engagement message referencing market changes or new inventory in their location
- Template library similar to nurture messages

#### [NEW] [portal_sync.py](file:///c:/Users/ZBOOK%20STUDIO%20G5/Documents/dev/reva/app/jobs/portal_sync.py)

Every 15 minutes:
- Call `portal_intercept.py` to poll Gmail inbox
- Extract new leads from PropertyPro / Nigeria Property Centre emails
- Deduplicate against existing leads by phone number
- Initiate WhatsApp outreach for new leads

#### [NEW] [roi_report.py](file:///c:/Users/ZBOOK%20STUDIO%20G5/Documents/dev/reva/app/jobs/roi_report.py)

Weekly Sunday 8pm:
- Query `revenue_intelligence` view from Supabase
- Generate plain-English email report (leads, qualified, booked, closed, revenue)
- Send via Gmail API or SendGrid to developer management team emails
- Designed to be board-forwardable

#### [MODIFY] [nurture.py](file:///c:/Users/ZBOOK%20STUDIO%20G5/Documents/dev/reva/app/jobs/nurture.py)

- Extract scheduler into a shared `scheduler.py` module
- Register all four jobs (nurture, resurrection, portal_sync, roi_report) in one scheduler
- All jobs scoped to Africa/Lagos timezone

#### [NEW] [scheduler.py](file:///c:/Users/ZBOOK%20STUDIO%20G5/Documents/dev/reva/app/jobs/scheduler.py)

Centralised APScheduler process:
- Replaces [start_scheduler()](file:///c:/Users/ZBOOK%20STUDIO%20G5/Documents/dev/reva/app/jobs/nurture.py#78-89) from [nurture.py](file:///c:/Users/ZBOOK%20STUDIO%20G5/Documents/dev/reva/app/jobs/nurture.py)
- Registers: nurture (daily 10am), resurrection (Monday 9am), portal_sync (every 15min), roi_report (Sunday 8pm)
- Single entry point for [main.py](file:///c:/Users/ZBOOK%20STUDIO%20G5/Documents/dev/reva/app/main.py) lifespan

