### Phase 6 — Client Surfaces

This is a significant build. The Next.js dashboard and admin panel are separate frontend projects.

---

#### [NEW] Next.js Dashboard (separate directory or repo)

- Pipedrive-style kanban board with drag-drop stages
- KPI bar (total leads, qualified, booked, conversion rate, revenue projection)
- Funnel drop-off visualization
- Real-time activity feed (Supabase Realtime)
- Lead detail view with conversation transcript
- Revenue projection chart
- Polls `/api/leads`, `/api/stats` every 30 seconds

> This is a large standalone build. Recommend deferring to Phase 6 while the static dashboard continues to serve.

#### [NEW] Admin Panel (within Next.js or separate)

- CRUD for property listings (add, edit, remove, upload images)
- Agent profile management (add/remove, toggle active, set development)
- Development management (add/remove, configure pricing)
- Reva personality customisation per tenant (custom prompt additions)
- No developer involvement after initial setup

