### Phase 8 — Multi-Tenancy & Security

---

#### [NEW] [005_rls_policies.sql](file:///c:/Users/ZBOOK%20STUDIO%20G5/Documents/dev/reva/migrations/005_rls_policies.sql)

Actual RLS policies (currently only `ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY`, no policies defined):
```sql
CREATE POLICY tenant_leads ON leads FOR ALL
  USING (tenant_id = current_setting('app.current_tenant_id')::uuid);
-- Repeat for properties, agents, developments, conversation_logs
```

#### [NEW] [tenant_middleware.py](file:///c:/Users/ZBOOK%20STUDIO%20G5/Documents/dev/reva/app/core/tenant_middleware.py)

FastAPI middleware that:
- Extracts `tenant_id` from JWT / API key / webhook configuration
- Sets `app.current_tenant_id` on every Supabase query
- Ensures cross-tenant data isolation at the API level

#### [MODIFY] [supabase.py](file:///c:/Users/ZBOOK%20STUDIO%20G5/Documents/dev/reva/app/db/supabase.py)

- Add `set_tenant_context(tenant_id)` helper called before queries
- RPC call to `SET LOCAL app.current_tenant_id = ...`

